taton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/d43a30ffad8ee3607a3f453f6f5557e39902ddc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:52:31Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:52:31Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"chore(submodule), doc(plans): Mount client-portals-site and record Step 1 findings\n\nThe new private client-portals-site repo is now mounted under sites/,\ntracking its development branch. The plan records what the scaffold\nestablished.\n\nPlan updates:\n- import.meta.glob works in live.config.ts. defineLiveCollection, however,\n  must be called there and only there, so per-folder config.ts files export\n  plain { loader, schema } objects.\n- pnpm 12''s one-day minimum release age stays on, so \"latest\" means the newest\n  release at least a day old.\n- TypeScript is pinned to 6 until astro check''s replacement supports 7.1.\n- Step 1 is done except the Vercel deploy.\n\nFiles changed:\n- .gitmodules\n- sites/client-portals-site\n- context-v/plans/Build-a-Client-Portals-Site.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ab2540ab62f8dcae270876d68cfafa71b117e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/0ab2540ab62f8dcae270876d68cfafa71b117e2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/d43a30ffad8ee3607a3f453f6f5557e39902ddc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/d43a30ffad8ee3607a3f453f6f5557e39902ddc4","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGQ0M2EzMGZmYWQ4ZWUzNjA3YTNmNDUzZjZmNTU1N2UzOTkwMmRkYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168","sha":"85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168"}],"sha":"d43a30ffad8ee3607a3f453f6f5557e39902ddc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/d43a30ffad8ee3607a3f453f6f5557e39902ddc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:48:34Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:48:34Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"doc(plans): Rework the client-portals plan around live content, MOCs and Edviro\n\nThe client-portals plan now updates content on push with no rebuild. It pulls\nin each client''s MOC reading list, routes every other link to the path the note\nactually has on lossless.group, and takes Edviro as its first portal.\n\nContent delivery moves from a committed `pnpm sync` to Astro 7 live content\ncollections with route caching. A GitHub push webhook on lossless-content and\ncontent-areas purges only the affected portals through Vercel''s tag\ninvalidation. A rebuild happens only when a collection''s config.ts changes.\n\nCollections each get a folder with their own config.ts under src/collections/,\nand live.config.ts only aggregates them. This is the pattern meant to\neventually break up lossless-site''s 610-line content.config.ts. Frontmatter is\nnormalized, never validated, and never fails a build or a request.\n\nMOCs are treated as curated reading lists. Every note a MOC names is fetched\nand rendered in the portal, one hop deep, and the MOC is parsed with LFM''s\nremark-directive pipeline instead of regex. A client is matched by name to its\nclient-content folder and its MOC, and the whole folder is pulled in.\n\nOutbound wikilinks are checked against lossless.group''s live sitemap (8,374\nURLs). The survey found the old URL table wrong for vocabulary, nested\nconcepts and content-areas. The sitemap also lists 316 public /client/ URLs.\nThat is noted as an open decision and deliberately not fixed.\n\nEdviro becomes the first portal: one market-scan report, no MOC yet, and the\nAI-Factories-Datacenters content area (102 files, only ~18 tagged for the\nclient). The plan adds a profile kind for the area''s 86 organizations.\n\nDependencies follow a latest-always policy (Astro 7.3.6, Svelte 5.57.2), and\nSvelte is installed from the first step. LFM comes from JSR at latest via the\nnpm alias. The repo is private, and passcode portals are never CDN-cached,\nbecause cached pages would bypass the gate.\n\nFiles changed:\n- context-v/plans/Build-a-Client-Portals-Site.md\n- context-v/plans/index.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cadd300dd178535349d3a326604e1b655ae9f4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/3cadd300dd178535349d3a326604e1b655ae9f4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDg1YzRlZGRlYTUwNzk2NGQwNjk2NmNjZGNlMmU5NTIyN2EzNTExNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f","sha":"ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f"}],"sha":"85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/85c4eddea507964d06966ccdce2e95227a351168"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:21:59Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:21:59Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(blueprints, prompts, CLAUDE.md): Point three-mode guidance at implementations that work\n\nNew sites were being told to copy hypernova-site''s mode switcher, which only\nhandles two modes and loses vibrant. The Quickstart also claimed the module\nswitchers run \"before first paint\"; they run after it, so stored modes flash.\n\nThe references are now:\n- lossless-toolkit-site: data-mode, plain CSS, mode set before first paint\n- the astro-knots splash: radiogroup toggle\n- lossless-slides-site: Tailwind v4 @custom-variant wiring, with its\n  data-theme deviation noted\n- fullstack-vc''s vibrant block, at its real lines 162-211 (not 90-130)\n\nThe Quickstart now includes the inline head script that prevents the flash,\nand the blueprint adds it as a required step. Each line reference was\nchecked against the source.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8521431b4b9f5378f0b1c360623263ca6290ca38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/8521431b4b9f5378f0b1c360623263ca6290ca38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGFkNzIzYjU2NzM4MjY2ZjY4MDI2YzdhY2ZiOTFjODg4Y2VhODM0MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/11314e648156bb8485d869881649b9ae4ee9ddac","sha":"11314e648156bb8485d869881649b9ae4ee9ddac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/11314e648156bb8485d869881649b9ae4ee9ddac"}],"sha":"ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/ad723b56738266f68026c7acfb91c888cea8341f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/11314e648156bb8485d869881649b9ae4ee9ddac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:21:59Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:21:59Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"doc(plans, explorations): Plan the client-portals-site and open the Lossless three-mode exploration\n\nThe client portals are the third surface pulled out of lossless-site, after\nthe changelog and the toolkit. The plan covers:\n- nine page kinds, each inferred from where a file sits in the vault, so\n  authors add nothing\n- a GitHub API sync of specific vault files, modeled on lossless-changelog''s\n  sync-streams, rather than mounting the vault as a submodule\n- a wikilink resolver that sends anything not pulled in to its live\n  www.lossless.group URL, never to /404\n- unlisted-by-default portals with an optional per-client passcode\n- robots.txt and llms.txt that tell crawlers and LLMs the site is not for them\n\nThe exploration gives the Lossless brand sites a shared light/dark/vibrant\nsystem:\n- vibrant is today''s lossless.group look, and every site defaults to it\n- light and dark are serif reading modes; dark''s ground is derived from the\n  brand gradient\n- the electric cyan stays in every mode by changing its job in light\n  (contrast measured)\n- the mode choice follows readers across clients., changelog. and\n  toolkit.lossless.group through a shared cookie mirrored to localStorage\n\nAlso included:\n- index.md for plans/ and explorations/, per the context-vigilance kit\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79985017ce3b5e48d7668afde645312068d01ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/79985017ce3b5e48d7668afde645312068d01ef2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/11314e648156bb8485d869881649b9ae4ee9ddac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co