usercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/2f7c93a3efe43178649a958f9ec4eeb602412f5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:14:20Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:14:20Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"changelog(2026-09-15), chore(submodule): Client portals, three invisible bugs, and slides-site\n\nRoll up the day''s work on lossless-toolkit-site and bump its pointer from\n1ed993e to e99267d — per-client portals with the Explorer scoped to each\nengagement, the same filter on /repositories/, and three fixes that a green\nbuild could not surface.\n\nThe entry''s throughline is that every bug that mattered passed every automated\ncheck: eighteen tests green, every route 200, and the site still had a filter\nbox that erased each keystroke, seven client icons that were 130 bytes of ASCII\nserved as image/png, and a page nothing linked to. A status code says the server\nanswered, not that the answer was an image or that the page is reachable.\n\nTwo measurements are recorded because each changed a decision: scoped endpoints\ncut a portal''s payload from 1,019 KB to 152 KB, and the tag distribution (median\n3, p90 6, max 13) showed slice(0, 3) was hiding tags on 41% of the catalogue.\n\nAdd lossless-slides-site as a submodule, checked out on main at 18ff61c.\n\nAlso included: the entry records that this submodule already exists on\norigin/main, so adding it here ends master''s clean fast-forward and buys a\nfuture .gitmodules conflict. Chosen, not stumbled into.\n\nNot included: sites/lossless-changelog has uncommitted working-tree edits that\npredate this session and are left untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f53472f48e27e2c4c330741382f8c91ac15f313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/5f53472f48e27e2c4c330741382f8c91ac15f313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/2f7c93a3efe43178649a958f9ec4eeb602412f5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u