 in one night, and the skill that came out of them\n\nCloses out the run: three sites redesigned as three complete directions each -\nnine working variants, twenty-seven direction-and-mode combinations, every one\noff a single shared content layer per site.\n\ngth-site turns a docuseries funnel into a clinical publication, an anatomical\natlas, or a consultation, with an upgrade cart whose tiers are strict supersets\nso it shows a delta instead of a whole new cart. dominocielo-site holds a\n300-word family-office page at 300 words and makes brevity read as confidence.\nmultiphasic-site got the README treatment its CEO''s interest deserved.\n\nThe entry records the two measurable outcomes worth repeating - the coined\nproduct term moving from word 5 to past word 200 on gth-site, and a word budget\nenforced as a build artifact on dominocielo-site - plus the three bugs that\nsurvived every green subagent report and were caught only by rasterizing the\nbuilt HTML and looking at it.\n\nAlso logs what fell out of the client work: the generate-site-design-variants\nskill, the /design-variants splash surface, a blueprint on superset-tier carts\nand a reminder on orienting before jargon.\n\nFiles changed:\n- changelog/2026-09-13_01.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NQ3zu2f6LfhfnU1fEiNDvP","tree":{"sha":"04fc1a9c3ee1bd9fbec3742c4d7405c4bda1e444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/04fc1a9c3ee1bd9fbec3742c4d7405c4bda1e444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/939b32584337860a3bf5f727f6e80c8ff15a8793","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/939b32584337860a3bf5f727f6e80c8ff15a8793","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDkzOWIzMjU4NDMzNzg2MGEzYmY1ZjcyN2Y2ZTgwYzhmZjE1YTg3OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/994d087febd5f5d9c83ed4c3dc5dfea25c24863c","sha":"994d087febd5f5d9c83ed4c3dc5dfea25c24863c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/994d087febd5f5d9c83ed4c3dc5dfea25c24863c"}],"sha":"939b32584337860a3bf5f727f6e80c8ff15a8793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/939b32584337860a3bf5f727f6e80c8ff15a8793"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/994d087febd5f5d9c83ed4c3dc5dfea25c24863c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T07:13:09Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T07:13:09Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"skill(generate-site-design-variants), feat(splash): Codify the three-directions workflow and give it a surface\n\nThree client spikes in a row produced the same shape of work, so the pattern\nis now written down as a skill rather than re-derived each time, and the\nsplash page has a page explaining it to people who are not us.\n\nThe skill encodes the ordering that makes the output trustworthy: extract the\nargument before any pixels, build N directions against ONE content layer,\nexpress variants as Tier 2 theme files rather than forks, hold the three-mode\ncontract per direction, ship one themed image family instead of a set per\nmode, and keep directions isolated so retiring the losers is a delete rather\nthan a refactor.\n\nNew skill (context-v/agent-skills/generate-site-design-variants/):\n- SKILL.md, 257 lines - seven phases, the constraint-in-code section on why a\n  rule in the content model beats a rule in a template, stack invariants\n  inherited from astro-knots, how to run it as a loop, a verification\n  checklist, and anti-patterns.\n\nSplash:\n- New /design-variants page walking the workflow with real examples from the\n  three spikes.\n- Three site-highlights entries - gth-site, dominocielo-site,\n  multiphasic-site - so the sites appear in the gallery with repo links.\n- Home page gains a \"Redesign a site as three real directions\" section and a\n  nav entry pointing at the new page.\n- seo.ts gains the designVariants entry.\n\nFiles changed:\n- context-v/agent-skills/generate-site-design-variants/SKILL.md\n- splash/src/pages/design-variants.astro\n- splash/src/pages/index.astro\n- splash/src/lib/seo.ts\n- splash/src/content/site-highlights/gth-site.md\n- splash/src/content/site-highlights/dominocielo-site.md\n- splash/src/content/site-highlights/multiphasic-site.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NQ3zu2f6LfhfnU1fEiNDvP","tree":{"sha":"4baccea58e9ba90cd5cd4c359484365c6cfc6de8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/4baccea58e9ba90cd5cd4c359484365c6cfc6de8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/994d087febd5f5d9c83ed4c3dc5dfea25c24863c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/994d087febd