ad with the client-facing half — three versions of the site,\nwhat each one is, what to click — and move the pseudomonorepo explainer,\nconventions table and architecture below a \"For the Handoff\" heading.\n\nAlso removes the \"speculative pitch / not commissioned / not endorsed\"\nframing from all three, which read as legal hedging toward people we\nactually know.\n\nSubmodules bumped:\n- sites/gth-site           afe8af2..1ae6cdb\n- sites/dominocielo-site   a1986bc..542871f\n- sites/multiphasic-site   620d52f..3dca1b6\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NQ3zu2f6LfhfnU1fEiNDvP","tree":{"sha":"9d1b6c1b099494025c7e21b1df4983c4c40ea4a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/9d1b6c1b099494025c7e21b1df4983c4c40ea4a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/316d0063d657a368e36706279e07c06bd691eb25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"}