ns two lines that never conflicted in substance. Local carried a\nhousekeeping sweep and the submodule wiring for the three design spikes;\norigin carried the LFM 0.6.0 propagation across the fleet, the packaged\nwikilink resolver migration for mpstaton-site, and the lossless-toolkit-site\nregistration.\n\nThe one overlap was the sites/mpstaton-site pointer, which both sides\nadvanced. Resolved in favour of origin''s 611011c — the local bump to\n32bc4a0 is an ancestor of it, so origin''s pointer already contains the\nthree commits the local bump was reaching for. Nothing is dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011aM1bMDk91Ty7fHsfKQZkr\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\t.gitmodules\n#\tsites/mpstaton-site\n#\tsites/twf_site","tree":{"sha":"58cca0c1d90dc9ef91ae844ce5b473a2ec73df13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/58cca0c1d90dc9ef91ae844ce5b473a2ec73df13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/f49ab50ef8cb496831ab09c1d991b0ef51b2a71b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/f49ab50ef8cb496831ab09c1d991b0ef51b2a71b","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGY0OWFiNTBlZjhjYjQ5NjgzMWFiMDljMWQ5OTFiMGVmNTFiMmE3MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526","sha":"4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a","sha":"f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a"}],"sha":"f49ab50ef8cb496831ab09c1d991b0ef51b2a71b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/f49ab50ef8cb496831ab09c1d991b0ef51b2a71b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T05:19:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T05:21:42Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"chore(submodules, sites, scripts): Wire the three design spikes in as submodules\n\nThe three prospective-client design spikes were published to their own\npublic repositories earlier today, but sat inside sites/ as untracked\nplain directories — visible to anyone working here, invisible to the\nparent repo, and belonging to neither. They are now registered as proper\nsubmodules, which is how every other site in sites/ is wired.\n\nAdopted in place rather than re-cloned. `git submodule add` against an\nexisting clone reports \"Adding existing repo at ''<path>'' to the index\"\nand registers it without touching the working tree, so nothing was\ndeleted and no gitignored material was put at risk.\n\nSubmodules added, each pinned to its current tip on main:\n- sites/dominocielo-site   a1986bc — single-family-office one-pager\n- sites/gth-site           afe8af2 — practitioner-led testing and content\n- sites/multiphasic-site   620d52f — materials-state-control deep tech\n\nEach entry carries an explicit `branch = main` in .gitmodules, matching\nthe existing entries so `git submodule update --remote` tracks the right\ntier rather than guessing.\n\nVerified before wiring, per the pseudomonorepos relocation preconditions:\n- Working trees clean, zero unpushed commits, zero stashes on all three\n- Local and remote branch sets identical (main only, no local-only work)\n- The one non-regenerable gitignored artifact — Multiphasic''s CONFIDENTIAL\n  source deck, 2.0 MB, absent from GitHub by design — was moved aside for\n  the operation and restored, SHA-256 verified unchanged, still ignored\n- Fresh clones of all three produce byte-identical trees to local, so the\n  remotes carry everything\n\nAlso included: scripts/dev-sites.sh, a launcher that runs several sites at\nonce on auto-assigned ports walking up from 4321, skipping any port already\nlistening. Discovery resolves a site by its final path segment, so nested\nlayouts still resolve. Kept deliberately as-is rather than tuned further —\nit is a utility we expect to reach for again, and the three site READMEs\nalready point at it.\n\nFiles changed:\n- .gitmodules\n- sites/dominocielo-site (pointer)\n- sites/gth-site (pointer)\n- sites/multiphasic-site (pointer)\n- scripts/dev-sites.sh\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011aM1bMDk91Ty7fHsfKQZkr","tree":{"sha":"1a835e03b5f89583836981f20923f04eedef60b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/1a835e03b5f89583836981f20923f04eedef60b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDRiMWNjZjYxN2FhZWI1ZTVmOTU5OTNhZmJkYTJhOWUzNDYyMTk1MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b","sha":"1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b"}],"sha":"4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/4b1ccf617aaeb5e5f95993afbda2a9e346219526"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T05:12:02Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T05:12:02Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"chore(clean): git misc updates and context current\n\nHousekeeping sweep at the parent-pointer level — advances two submodules\nto their current tips, records a transitive lockfile bump, and brings two\ngeneralized patterns into the shared context-v where the rest of the\nestate can reach them.\n\nSubmodule pointers (advanced, not committed into — work was done in each\nsite''s own repo):\n\n- sites/mpstaton-site: 2930ac6 -> 32bc4a0 (3 commits). An events diary\n  that renders availability rather than just agenda, share cards carrying\n  the event and its dates, and a fix naming the street address because\n  two Hyatts near SFO is one too many.\n- sites/twf_site: 80f4b3f -> d397d7d (2 commits). Roster correction with\n  a bio''s pronouns fixed, and a header fix stopping the logo from\n  animating itself into place on every page load.\n\ncontext-v additions — both were extracted from the practitioner-site\ndesign spike, where they earned their keep by solving a real client\nproblem, and both generalize past it:\n\n- blueprints/Build-an-Upgrade-Ladder-Cart-from-Superset-Tiers.md — make\n  every tier a strict superset of the one below and the cart can show a\n  delta instead of swapping in a whole new cart.\n- reminders/Orient-Before-You-Introduce-a-Term-of-Art.md — a reader who\n  does not yet know what the thing is cannot learn its name; enforce\n  plain question before clinical title in the schema, not in review.\n\nThese two now resolve the absolute links in lossless-group/gth-site''s\nREADME, which pointed here on the expectation that they would land.\n\npnpm-lock.yaml carries a single transitive bump, @napi-rs/wasm-runtime\n1.1.6 -> 1.2.3. It arrives through design-system-viewer''s toolchain and\nis an optional win32-arm64 binding that never installs on macOS, so\nnothing local exercises it and no deployed site is affected — sites are\nnot workspace members and carry their own lockfiles.\n\nFiles changed:\n- pnpm-lock.yaml\n- sites/mpstaton-site (pointer)\n- sites/twf_site (pointer)\n- context-v/blueprints/Build-an-Upgrade-Ladder-Cart-from-Superset-Tiers.md\n- context-v/reminders/Orient-Before-You-Introduce-a-Term-of-Art.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011aM1bMDk91Ty7fHsfKQZkr","tree":{"sha":"02095134b93ce6ae61c42e7b220103907e2c0a19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/02095134b93ce6ae61c42e7b220103907e2c0a19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDFhNzlkNTEzNWEzMTA1ZDgzMjc4NmQzNGM2YTNmZmQ0N2U3MTkzMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/2dc16c619485c9450bb685c05a3366ee3c29956a","sha":"2dc16c619485c9450bb685c05a3366ee3c29956a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/2dc16c619485c9450bb685c05a3366ee3c29956a"}],"sha":"1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1a79d5135a3105d832786d34c6a3ffd47e71931b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:27:31Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:27:31Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"chore(submodule): bump lossless-toolkit-site\n\nCarries the serve-variants port-fallback fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KgoyLaiNwHLVEp9jo6swpZ","tree":{"sha":"629ce8ac41231bea0ca97e3a23761ca809367aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/629ce8ac41231bea0ca97e3a23761ca809367aaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGY5ZDkxYTVhYmFiMzNiZDJhMjVhNGEyZmI2ODkzYzliOTIzMTNlNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde","sha":"da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde"}],"sha":"f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/f9d91a5abab33bd2a25a4a2fb6893c9b92313e6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:27:01Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:27:01Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"new(context-v): Issue doc for finishing the wikilink verification elsewhere\n\nThe mpstaton-site wikilink migration is written, pushed, and provably equivalent\nto the rules it replaces — but nobody has watched it resolve a single real link.\nThe content it needs is fetched from other repos through the GitHub API, which\nrate-limits at 60 requests/hour without a token, and the tokens live on another\nmachine. So the verification moves machines, and this is the pick-up doc.\n\nIt records what shipped, what was verified and by what method, and — most\nimportantly — the one claim that is NOT verified: a full build produced zero\nliteral wikilinks outside code spans and zero resolved anchors. That is\nconsistent with two very different explanations (the corpus has no matching\nlinks, or the plugin is not running on those pages) and the evidence does not\ndistinguish them. The doc names the cheapest check that would: the essays page\nalready wires a dev-only warning to `onUnresolved`, so `pnpm dev` either prints\nmisses or prints nothing, and those mean different things.\n\nAlso recorded are the three environment blockers that consumed most of the\nsession, each with its cause rather than just its fix — an undeclared\n`unist-util-visit` that had been breaking the build before any of this work\nbegan, pnpm 11''s `allowBuilds` placeholder that makes `pnpm install` exit 1 in\na way that does not resolve itself, and `bun` being reachable only inside a\ndevshell when the project''s own build script invokes it directly.\n\nThe actual blocker is documentation, not code: the fetch scripts look for\nGITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN / GITHUB_CONTENT_PAT / GITHUB_TOKEN / GH_TOKEN and\nYOUTUBE_API_KEY, and `.env.example` documents none of them. Anyone setting the\nsite up hits the same wall with nothing written down. The doc names that as the\nsmallest useful fix.\n\nFiles changed:\n- context-v/issues/Verifying-the-Wikilink-Resolver-Migration-on-mpstaton-site.md\n\nAlso included:\n- Bumps the mpstaton-site submodule pointer to 611011c, which carries the\n  pnpm-workspace.yaml fix for the exit-1 above.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KgoyLaiNwHLVEp9jo6swpZ","tree":{"sha":"7a48c176325a214354d030f1410e8967d33e5dd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/7a48c176325a214354d030f1410e8967d33e5dd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGRhNzVmZTYyNjRkM2VjZDcyNzJiOGFiODY4ZDIwZDYyYTNhNjlkZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2","sha":"57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2"}],"sha":"da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/da75fe6264d3ecd7272b8ab868d20d62a3a69dde"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T22:46:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T22:46:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"update(mpstaton-site): Migrate to the packaged wikilink resolver\n\nCloses the item the fleet roll deliberately left open. The site-local\nremark-lossless-wikilinks-local.ts is retired in favour of 0.6.0''s\nremarkLfmWikilinks + createPathResolver, with destinations in\nsrc/config/wikilinks.ts — the file scripts/wikilink-rules.ts predicted.\n\nOld and new implementations were diffed across twelve paths: 12 identical, 0\ndifferent. Awaiting a human browser check on real content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KgoyLaiNwHLVEp9jo6swpZ","tree":{"sha":"aa448b64d222dcc3f241927a6f5994bc3d96c019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/aa448b64d222dcc3f241927a6f5994bc3d96c019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDU3ZGQwNjEyNTg3MDVkZmM0OTU2NDgyYWNjNGIwMzg4MTMyZjBiYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7","sha":"1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7"}],"sha":"57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/57dd061258705dfc4956482acc4b0388132f0bb2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T22:16:28Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T22:16:28Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"update(sites): Roll LFM 0.6.0 across the fleet, per the propagation loop\n\nFirst run of the loop recorded in context-v/loops. Every site that consumes\n@lossless-group/lfm now installs 0.6.0 from JSR, and each site''s development,\nmain and master are at parity.\n\n    mpstaton-site        0.5.1  -> 0.6.0\n    lossless-changelog   0.5.1  -> 0.6.0\n    fullstack-vc        ^0.5.0  -> ^0.6.0\n    twf_site            ^0.3.0  -> ^0.6.0\n    lossless-toolkit-site  file: -> 0.6.0   (already rolled)\n\nThe loop earned its keep on the first run, though not in the way it was written\nto. 0.6.0 itself was uneventful — it is opt-in, no site configures `paths` yet,\nand no rendering changed. What the build step caught was three sites importing\npackages they never declared:\n\n    mpstaton-site   unist-util-visit  (from src/lib/, build FAILED on main)\n    fullstack-vc    vite              (from astro.config.mjs)\n    fullstack-vc    shiki             (from src/lib/)\n\nmpstaton-site''s build was already broken before this change. All three resolved\nonly by accident of hoisting, and stop resolving under a stricter install layout.\nEach is now declared.\n\nAlso caught: mpstaton-site pinned the LFM version in a second place —\nscripts/lfm-mode.mjs hardcoded 0.5.1 — so a package.json bump alone would have\nbeen reverted the next time anyone ran `pnpm lfm:jsr`.\n\nLeft undone, deliberately: mpstaton-site still carries the hand-rolled\nremark-lossless-wikilinks-local.ts and scripts/wikilink-rules.ts that 0.6.0''s\ncreatePathResolver exists to replace. That migration touches three page\ntemplates and an audit script, and is worth doing against a browser drive the\nsite does not yet have. The loop''s own step 5 says a bump that leaves the\nsuperseded code in place has not migrated anything — recorded rather than\npretended.\n\nVerified per site: clean build, exit 0. 508 pages (lossless-changelog), 162\n(fullstack-vc), 81 (twf_site), 8 (mpstaton-site — its collections are populated\nby a fetch step needing bun and network, unrelated).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KgoyLaiNwHLVEp9jo6swpZ","tree":{"sha":"8af92078a835037af83fec417fda9598c97795cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/8af92078a835037af83fec417fda9598c97795cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDFlZTUxY2NkMjIzYzRiZDBkMDgyM2U5NGNlODgyMGRjMGMzY2QwYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc","sha":"6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc"}],"sha":"1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1ee51ccd223c4bd0d0823e94ce8820dc0c3cd0a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:18:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:18:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"new(context-v): A loop for rolling a published LFM release across the sites\n\nPublishing to JSR is the start of a release, not the end. LFM has no site of\nits own, so a regression only shows up in the five sites that install it, and\nthe fleet is currently spread across three versions — 0.5.1, ^0.5.0, ^0.3.0,\nand one site on a local `file:` path that cannot deploy at all.\n\nThe cadence is deliberately one site at a time, riskiest first, so a bad\nrelease is caught on the first subject rather than after four dirty submodules.\nSeven steps per site: bump to the JSR npm-compat specifier, build, diff the\nrendered HTML, drive a browser, delete whatever the release supersedes,\nchangelog, push the submodule and update the parent pointer.\n\nTwo things it insists on that a generic dependency sweep does not. The\nverification rung is a browser drive rather than a green build, because the\noutput of this package is rendered HTML and every defect in the spike session\nthat produced 0.6.0 passed both `pnpm build` and `curl`. And a bump that leaves\nthe superseded code in place has not migrated anything — mpstaton-site''s\nhand-rolled wikilink resolver is the concrete case, and its own header calls\nitself a stopgap that goes away when the package ships this.\n\nMarked Unproven. It has not been run end to end; lossless-toolkit-site is the\nintended first subject. Sibling to Dependency-Upgrade-Loop, which sweeps all\ndependencies broadly rather than one package deeply.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KgoyLaiNwHLVEp9jo6swpZ","tree":{"sha":"2796bc8ecb361f40142e0eefbe679974a76e8248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/2796bc8ecb361f40142e0eefbe679974a76e8248"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDYxOTEwNTI5NjA4MTBiN2EzZjU2MDk4NTYwZDU5NGIzNGNjNDA1Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8","sha":"1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8"}],"sha":"6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/6191052960810b7a3f56098560d594b34cc405cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:38:42Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:38:42Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"bump(submodule): sites/mpstaton-site — advance to the site''s own tip\n\nWrap-up pointer bump. The site repo had moved ahead of what astro-knots\nrecorded; this catches the parent up so a fresh clone resolves the work that\nis already pushed rather than a tip several commits stale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UruR2CRdrNBNL6ebmvwjRq","tree":{"sha":"026495b08693da6caaaad7d402cd8eea16280b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/026495b08693da6caaaad7d402cd8eea16280b70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDExMjhkNDNhNzgyMDI3ZmQ0NTI1MWU2NTUwMDkyMDg2ZjNlOGRmZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/086f6292b4bf504c6592de63a77c7a327e3be681","sha":"086f6292b4bf504c6592de63a77c7a327e3be681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/086f6292b4bf504c6592de63a77c7a327e3be681"}],"sha":"1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/1128d43a782027fd45251e6550092086f3e8dff8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.