.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/c0327bcda38b1b26c57b816d2d6601148028ea88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T01:13:28Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T01:13:28Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"doc(context-v): backfill publish across eighty-four documents\n\nEvery document that lacked the key now carries one. Seventy-three true,\neleven false — read per document rather than set in bulk, which is the only\nway this field works: a stale Stub banner over a developed body is true, and\na polished title over placeholder sections is false, so a word count gets\nboth backwards.\n\nNo existing value was changed. Eighty-four insertions, zero deletions, which\nis the check that matters here — flipping a considered false to true is the\none edit this field must never receive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H4m2VTBgBQY3bErHAGGdjw","tree":{"sha":"e4e290223f0ce5c5d1d47505d57ccc0c8004560e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/e4e290223f0ce5c5d1d47505d57ccc0c8004560e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/c0327bcda38b1b26c57b816d2d6601148028ea88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/c0327bcda38b1b26c57b816d2d6601148028ea88","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGMwMzI3YmNkYTM4YjFiMjZjNTdiODE2ZDJkNjYwMTE0ODAyOGVhODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/818519c6b3662a1053ce01e63050b49fb8c9f59a","sha":"818519c6b3662a1053ce01e63050b49fb8c9f59a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/818519c6b3662a1053ce01e63050b49fb8c9f59a"}],"sha":"c0327bcda38b1b26c57b816d2d6601148028ea88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/c0327bcda38b1b26c57b816d2d6601148028ea88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/818519c6b3662a1053ce01e63050b49fb8c9f59a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:27:55Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T06:27:55Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"doc(context-v): record the nine duplicated frontmatter parsers\n\nWrites up the duplication behind today''s block-scalar fix: src/loaders/\nfrontmatter.ts exists in nine copies across the tree, so one YAML bug had to\nbe fixed nine times.\n\nEstablishes by normalized comparison that the nine are functionally\nidentical — six byte-hashes collapse to two, and those two differ only in\nbrace style — so no site has earned a bespoke parser and consolidation is\nprovably safe. Also records why LFM does not own this today: it is a\nrendering pipeline, and nothing in the tree owns content loading.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H4m2VTBgBQY3bErHAGGdjw","tree":{"sha":"411ddd5b5c9feeb87064bdde6eea7e07824cec8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/411ddd5b5c9feeb87064bdde6eea7e07824cec8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/818519c6b3662a1053ce01e63050b49fb8c9f59a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.