s/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/b82095914e548e24e843bfc2817f50833de76034/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:20:58Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:20:58Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"document(agents): adopt the browser-drive verification block\n\nRolls the shared browser-drive section into astro-knots'' CLAUDE.md, delimited by\nthe lossless:browser-drive markers so the kit can update it in place later. Says\nthat agents verify UI work by driving a real browser before asking a human to\nwalk the surface — Playwright MCP as the codified default, `claude --chrome` for\ninteractive runs — and records the rules that keep it cheap: prefer accessibility\nsnapshots over screenshots, writes only against a designated safe target, and a\nbrowser drive augments the human walkthrough rather than replacing it.\n\nWas sitting uncommitted in the working tree; committing it separately from the\nsplash change so the doc rollout stays legible in history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jATLVd7NuyyCbANarbktz","tree":{"sha":"27da0f4dbf2909767c42caf5197d2ede20062d54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/27da0f4dbf2909767c42caf5197d2ede20062d54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/b82095914e548e24e843bfc2817f50833de76034","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","