b.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/50b6f05bd7393aae1e16e8260e47f3615696806b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:20:09Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:20:09Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"add(splash), update(submodules): mount learnstart-site in the gallery\n\nlearnstart-site joins the splash gallery as a maintained site — the Pre-Seed to\nSeed arm of Learn Capital, live at learnstart.vc. Card sits at order 15 with\nlearn.vc''s lime (#0cea99) as its thread color, and llms.txt picks up the new\nentry automatically since SITE_COUNT is derived from the collection rather than\nhardcoded.\n\nThe site earns its place as a reference for two patterns worth copying: OG share\ncards rendered as real Astro pages (composing the site''s own FlameMark component\nand theme tokens, then photographed by headless Chrome, so the card cannot drift\nfrom the brand), and a Sveltia-published stream system on @lossless-group/lfm\nthat a non-technical editor drives without touching git.\n\nSubmodule pointers advanced to commits already on their respective origins:\nlearnstart-site to ab5c0d4 (OG cards + backfilled changelogs), fullstack-vc to\n7bca7f5.\n\nAlso included: the splash README claimed \"12 sibling sites\" while the gallery\nheld fourteen. Replaced the hardcoded count with a pointer at\nsrc/content/site-highlights/, so the sentence stops rotting every time a site is\nadded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai