les entries\n\nFleet-wide branch-tier parity pass across Astro Knots. Each of the 9\nsites below got a semver bump, any pending uncommitted work\ncommitted, and development/master branches synced to main (created\nwhere missing, fast-forwarded where they already existed).\nhypernova-site is deliberately excluded — its development/master\ndivergence needs manual reconciliation, not an automated sync.\n\nSite bumps:\n- fullstack-vc 0.1.1 → 0.1.2\n- cilantro-site 0.0.0.3 → 0.0.1.0 (dependency-upgrade-driven bump)\n- mpstaton-site 0.0.1 → 0.0.2 (+ Giide deal entry, new working note)\n- dark-matter 0.2.3 → 0.2.4\n- banner-site 0.0.7 → 0.0.8\n- twf_site 1.0.1.0 → 1.0.2.0 (+ new llms.txt/GEO + SEO registry feature)\n- cogs-site 0.0.1 → 0.0.2 (+ changelog/ scaffold retrospective)\n- coglet-shuffle (+ changelog/ migration retrospective; version lives\n  in the untracked nested astro-site/, left untouched — see below)\n- arthouse-site 0.0.2 → 0.0.3 (+ Astro 6→7, vercel 10→11, svelte 8→9\n  dependency upgrade, build-verified)\n\nAlso included:\n- Added `branch = main` to every .gitmodules entry that was missing\n  it (coglet-shuffle, cogs-site, twf_site, dark-matter, banner-site,\n  mpstaton-site, fullstack-vc), matching the existing cilantro-site/\n  arthouse-site entries. hypernova-site''s entry is left without a\n  branch= field since it''s currently checked out on master, not main.\n- coglet-shuffle/astro-site is a nested, unregistered git repo whose\n  only remote is a foreign `Parslee-ai/steampunk-site` org (earlier\n  client work, not built out per the user). Left entirely untouched.\n\nFiles changed:\n- .gitmodules\n- sites/arthouse-site, sites/banner-site, sites/cilantro-site,\n  sites/coglet-shuffle, sites/cogs-site, sites/dark-matter,\n  sites/fullstack-vc, sites/mpstaton-site, sites/twf_site","tree":{"sha":"a4deff14edd4a7c2b3e531e4692f27702aa665d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/a4deff14edd4a7c2b3e531e4692f27702aa665d3"},"u