lls get the per-skill symlink Claude Code needs to discover them. This codifies the fix for six skills that were authored but unlinked and therefore invisible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33036b44f8e1b87ccbba13f3f7a05d7242c8ab81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/33036b44f8e1b87ccbba13f3f7a05d7242c8ab81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/6d1af02dd3e0b956179e60cc9546a7646abc2826","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/6d1af02dd3e0b956179e60cc9546a7646abc2826","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDZkMWFmMDJkZDNlMGI5NTYxNzllNjBjYzk1NDZhNzY0NmFiYzI4MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/bdb11ebb2925d31d7946fa432c24e09b3de05f46","sha":"bdb11ebb2925d31d7946fa432c24e09b3de05f46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/bdb11ebb2925d31d7946fa432c24e09b3de05f46"}],"sha":"6d1af02dd3e0b956179e60cc9546a7646abc2826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/6d1af02dd3e0b956179e60cc9546a7646abc2826"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/bdb11ebb2925d31d7946fa432c24e09b3de05f46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T23:05:55Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T21:50:41Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"add(reminders): Astro frontmatter parser misreads inline block comments and slash-heavy regex literals\n\nNew reminder file documenting two parser traps caught while building\nshell-side routes in dididecks-ai today. Both stem from esbuild''s TS\npre-parse in .astro frontmatter blocks classifying tokens incorrectly\nin regex-vs-divide ambiguity zones.\n\nTrap 1: inline `/* */` block comments after a `;` are sometimes\nparsed as the start of a regex literal (because `;` re-enters\nexpression position). Build fails with \"Unterminated regular\nexpression\" at a column position past the end of the affected line —\nthe parser is reporting where the regex *should* have terminated, not\nwhere it started.\n\nTrap 2: chained multi-slash regex literals in expression-adjacent\npositions (e.g. `a.match(/.../) ?? b.match(/.../)`) can trip the\nsame ambiguity. Patterns themselves are syntactically valid;\nclassification of the surrounding context is the issue.\n\nThree workarounds in order of contained scope:\n  - Prefer line comments over inline /* */ block comments\n  - Prefer string methods (split/startsWith/lastIndexOf/slice) over\n    regex literals when the logic is structural\n  - If regex is the right tool, hoist to top-of-file const declaration\n\nBonus corollary trap documented in the \"where this does NOT apply\"\nsection: JSDoc blocks at the top of frontmatter terminate early if\nthey contain `*/` sequences (path examples like `data/**/team/`).\nWrap such examples in backticks or rephrase in prose.\n\nCompanion to the existing YAML-Frontmatter-Parsing-Must-Be-Lenient\nreminder. Realized example: dididecks-ai/apps/deck-shell/src/\ncomponents/DeckStatsPanel.astro (2026-05-17).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28b286251c05983e396803468635957230e27d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/28b286251c05983e396803468635957230e27d6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/bdb11ebb2925d31d7946fa432c24e09b3de05f46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{