879713dcad6896d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/3e5a678d0dac2410df98e0446e367ed142d97c1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T00:08:50Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T00:08:50Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"feat(wikilinks, plans, lfm-astro): wikilink resolution system v0.5.0 — plan, canonical scripts, audit\n\nFirst milestone of the wikilink resolution work, encoded across two\nnew context-v/plans/ docs, two canonical scripts in packages/lfm-astro/,\nand the mpstaton-site submodule bump that brings the site copies into\nthe tracked tree.\n\nPlan documents (context-v/plans/, new dir):\n\n- Wikilink-Resolution-System.md (v0.5.0) — the architectural plan.\n  Two-layer split: LFM provides remarkLosslessWikilinks parsing +\n  resolver-driven transform; sites provide the resolver via\n  src/config/wikilinks.ts. Documents all seven Obsidian wikilink syntax\n  shapes, the case-insensitive resolution rule, the \"render unresolved\n  as plain text + log to audit\" operating principle, the bare-wikilinks-\n  are-intentionally-non-resolvable decision, deferred-prefix tracking,\n  and a three-phase implementation roadmap. The naming convention\n  (remarkLossless* for all LFM-flavored deviations from standard remark)\n  is codified, and the broader rename of remarkCallouts/remarkCitations/\n  remarkLinkPreview/remarkOgFetcher folds into the same 0.3.0 release\n  that introduces the wikilinks plugin.\n\n- Wikilink-Path-Audit__mpstaton-site.md — the live worklist generated\n  from mpstaton-site/scripts/audit-wikilinks.ts. 354 unique wikilink\n  paths across 15 prefixes, 208 resolved (59%) via 7 rules, 44 deferred,\n  102 remaining for in-Obsidian triage. Bare wikilinks (91) and\n  absolute-path wikilinks (1) get top-of-doc explanatory sections —\n  they''re triage-worklist items, not config items. Re-running the script\n  regenerates the doc deterministically from rules + content; resolution\n  decisions live in the rules file, not in the audit''s frontmatter.\n\nCanonical scripts (packages/lfm-astro/scripts/, new dir):\n\n- audit-wikilinks.ts — the canonical version of the audit script.\n  Walks src/content/, parses every wikilink syntax shape, groups\n  case-insensitively by top-level prefix, applies rules, writes the\n  audit doc. Sites copy + adapt — not a runtime dependency.\n\n- wikilink-rules.ts — the canonical rules pattern. Three rule shapes\n  (PrefixRule, ExactRule, DeferredRule) plus a `resolvePath()` helper.\n  The shape is canonical; the rules below are mpstaton-site-specific\n  (Vocabulary/, Tooling/, etc. routing to lossless.group destinations)\n  and exist as a worked example. Other sites copy this file and replace\n  the rule arrays with their own destinations.\n\nBoth files include a header noting \"CANONICAL PATTERN (copy + adapt\nper site)\" — same convention as packages/lfm-astro/components/. Sites\ndo `cp packages/lfm-astro/scripts/*.ts <site>/scripts/` and then edit\nthe rules to match their own content destinations.\n\nSubmodule bump:\n\n- sites/mpstaton-site → 243674c (the site-side commit landing the\n  scripts in the running site, plus the package.json npm script).\n\nWhat''s intentionally NOT in this milestone:\n\n- The remarkLosslessWikilinks plugin in lfm (Phase 1 of the plan).\n- The src/config/wikilinks.ts integration in mpstaton-site (Phase 2).\n- Reader-visible wikilink rendering. Essays still surface raw [[...]]\n  syntax until Phase 1+2 land. v0.5.0 is \"system in place, ready to\n  render.\" v1.0.0 ships when an essay round-trips with resolved\n  hyperlinks.\n\nWhy v0.5.0 and not v1.0: this is delicate given how many sites and\nhow much content depend on it. The rules pattern wants validation\nacross multiple sites before locking in as v1.\n\nFiles changed:\n\n- context-v/plans/Wikilink-Resolution-System.md (new)\n- context-v/plans/Wikilink-Path-Audit__mpstaton-site.md (new — generated)\n- packages/lfm-astro/scripts/audit-wikilinks.ts (new — canonical)\n- packages/lfm-astro/scripts/wikilink-rules.ts (new — canonical)\n- sites/mpstaton-site (submodule pointer → 243674c)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30e6cbd0852446dabf04b89b65a7994a33dc1dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/30e6cbd0852446dabf04b89b65a7994a33dc1dd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/3e5a678d0dac2410df98e0446e367ed142d97c1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id"