pi.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/474b967907d40851c731d6d19514bf7ba94fb1cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T20:42:30Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T20:42:30Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"almost(playlists, video-spec): split playlist into orchestrator + sibling components, sync spec\n\nThe playlist UI now matches the two-sibling architecture: a player\ncard that flows in the article column and a scroller that\nescape-positions itself in the right margin track. Spec updated to\nreflect the corrected architecture; submodule pointer bumped to the\nimplementation commit.\n\ncontext-v/specs/Versatile-Component-Library-for-Video-Players.md:\n- §4.1.3.1 — PlaylistItem.addedAt? added to the cache schema; default\n  sort decoupling visual order from playback addressing documented\n- §4.1.3.3 — rewritten from \"single card with internal grid\" to\n  \"two sibling elements\"; new ASCII diagram showing player in\n  column + scroller in right margin with prose flowing under;\n  rationale for the two-sibling shape; breakpoint table\n- §4.1.3.4 — new \"two-component DOM\" subsection showing the actual\n  markup the orchestrator emits and the iframeId-as-only-contract\n  communication model\n- §4.1.3.5 — new section codifying the aside-escape CSS recipe\n  including the (100vw - 100%) / 2 math and the path to extracting\n  MarginEscape.astro when a second consumer needs it\n- §4.1.3.6, §4.1.3.7 — renumbered (was .5 and .6)\n\nsites/mpstaton-site:\n- Submodule bumped to 5a2ad2c which ships YouTubePlaylistPlayer.astro,\n  YouTubePlaylistScroller.astro, and the slimmed orchestrator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a3300ab2d4859ce82774e83d4d0a3e8921b5dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/3a3300ab2d4859ce82774e83d4d0a3e8921b5dff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/474b967907d40851c731d6d19514bf7ba94fb1cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/474b967907d40851c731d6d19514bf7ba94fb1cd","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKDQ3NGI5Njc5MDdkNDA4NTFjNzMxZDZkMTk1MTRiZjdiYTk0ZmIxY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/792183740eb0dca609a2e32de8777498f7078c29","sha":"792183740eb0dca609a2e32de8777498f7078c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/792183740eb0dca609a2e32de8777498f7078c29"}],"sha":"474b967907d40851c731d6d19514bf7ba94fb1cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/474b967907d40851c731d6d19514bf7ba94fb1cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","even