ched assets (favicon, light logo, dark logo)\n- Inserted tokens into global.css under ''# Fetched Brand, Starting Point''\n- Wired Reach brand colors to semantic tokens\n- Adapted light/dark/vibrant modes to use Reach palette\n\nPrimary colors:\n- Reach purple (#1f1646) - 34 occurrences\n- Reach teal (#218099) - 11 occurrences\n- Reach orange (#ff8300) - 9 occurrences\n\nBuild verified: 3 pages build successfully with new brand tokens.","tree":{"sha":"266a376825d4cc0312c3e8dc90f3b7be97f7550e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/266a376825d4cc0312c3e8dc90f3b7be97f7550e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/ae2252dcc7e2a07a5e17ad96744e32f308e27aa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/ae2252dcc7e2a07a5e17ad96744e32f308e27aa2","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGFlMjI1MmRjYzdlMmEwN2E1ZTE3YWQ5Njc0NGUzMmYzMDhlMjdhYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/621f2cd10a50f32246a54423b6684a357907176a","sha":"621f2cd10a50f32246a54423b6684a357907176a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/621f2cd10a50f32246a54423b6684a357907176a"}],"sha":"ae2252dcc7e2a07a5e17ad96744e32f308e27aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/ae2252dcc7e2a07a5e17ad96744e32f308e27aa2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/621f2cd10a50f32246a54423b6684a357907176a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T21:10:46Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T21:10:46Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"prompt: Fetch brand and tokens from client site\n\nNew prompt documenting how to bootstrap theme.css by fetching colors,\nfonts, and design assets from a client''s existing website.\n\nUse case: reach-edu-hub fetching from https://reach.edu/\n\nTechnical approach:\n- curl client homepage and CSS files\n- Extract colors via frequency analysis (grep hex codes)\n- Extract fonts from font-family declarations\n- Fetch logo and favicon\n- Insert into two-tier token system (named → semantic)\n- Improvise dark/vibrant modes from client''s light mode\n\nTool call sequence documented:\n- Fetch HTML with curl -L -A Mozilla\n- Parse for <link stylesheet> tags\n- Extract colors: grep -oE ''#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}'' | sort | uniq -c\n- Extract fonts: grep ''font-family:''\n- Fetch assets: curl logo/favicon to public/\n\nCaveats covered:\n- Most clients don''t have modes (we improvise)\n- CSS obfuscation handling\n- Font licensing (note name, don''t download files)\n- Logo usage rights\n- Starting point, not strict rules\n\nComplete example flow for reach-edu-hub included with bash commands\nand expected output.\n\nFiles created:\n- context-v/prompts/Fetch-Brand-and-Tokens-from-Site.md\n\nCross-references:\n- New-Site-Quickstart-Guide.md (Phase 6)\n- theme-system skill\n- astro-knots playbook §8","tree":{"sha":"a975027df722d2f6054c89fdc12ef93789e17cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/a975027df722d2f6054c89fdc12ef93789e17cff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/621f2cd10a50f32246a54423b6684a357907176a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","re