":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"Doc: Fix vibrant mode guidance in quickstart\n\nProblem: Setup playbook didn''t emphasize that vibrant mode must be\ndark-based, leading to light/vibrant being indistinguishable.\n\nChanges to Phase 6 documentation:\n- Added §6.2 examples showing vibrant mode is dark-based\n- Added §6.6 vibrant verification checklist\n- Emphasized critical requirement: vibrant MUST set surface/text/border tokens\n- Added multi-color gradient examples (lime → cyan → blue → violet)\n- Clarified glassmorphic surfaces use color-mix()\n- Referenced fullstack-vc as canonical vibrant implementation\n\nKey teaching point: Vibrant mode is \"dark mode but louder\" — neon\nborders, multi-stop gradients, high glow opacity, glassmorphic surfaces.\nNOT just light mode with higher --fx-glow-opacity.","tree":{"sha":"482e690378bd6be38d28a628adf5001c9ebf62ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/482e690378bd6be38d28a628adf5001c9ebf62ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/732cf4b91ac601e55fdf4963f714f4a621e6f6c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}