26-05-04T20:22:50Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"Add reach-edu-hub site as submodule\n\nNew client hub for Reach University materials collaboration.\n\nScaffolding complete per Astro-Knots playbook:\n- Astro 6 + Tailwind 4 + TypeScript 6\n- Three-mode system (light/dark/vibrant)\n- LFM markdown rendering ready\n- /brand-kit and /design-system reference pages\n- Vercel deployment configured\n\nSite repo: https://github.com/lossless-group/reach-edu-hub","tree":{"sha":"a00933ab467833f7c9a95a19fe6dfc84aad2b8a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/a00933ab467833f7c9a95a19fe6dfc84aad2b8a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/ecb952e8c067d0af893aaa889eeb2ced892096e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/ecb952e8c067d0af893aaa889eeb2ced892096e9","node_id":"C_kwDOPb7AGdoAKGVjYjk1MmU4YzA2N2QwYWY4OTNhYWE4ODllZWIyY2VkODkyMDk2ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/astro-knots/commit/b69ed5004787d1bf3460ac6d10da03d745b746bf","sha":"b69ed5004787d1bf3460ac6d10da03d745b746bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/b69ed5004787d1bf3460ac6d10da03d745b746bf"}],"sha":"ecb952e8c067d0af893aaa889eeb2ced892096e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/ecb952e8c067d0af893aaa889eeb2ced892096e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/commits/b69ed5004787d1bf3460ac6d10da03d745b746bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T02:02:11Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T02:02:11Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"feature(lfm): :::link-preview / :::link-rollup directives + OG fetch foundation\n\nFirst end-to-end vertical slice of LFM spec §4.23.6.\n\nNew plugins (packages/lfm/src/plugins/):\n- remark-og-fetcher — walks external link nodes, dedupes, enriches each\n  with LinkPreviewData via a pluggable backend.\n- remark-link-preview — annotates :::link-preview / :::link-rollup\n  containerDirectives with a typed LinkPreviewSpec including per-URL OG\n  items copied off each enriched link node.\n\nNew utilities (packages/lfm/src/utils/):\n- classify-link — lifted from sites/mpstaton-site/src/lib/markdown/.\n  Pure URL classifier shared across consuming sites.\n- og-cache — hashed-URL JSON cache, separate TTLs for hits and failures,\n  atomic write.\n- og-dispatcher — in-process semaphore for concurrency, sliding-window\n  per-minute rate limiter, per-month soft-cap warning, exponential-backoff\n  retries on retryable status codes.\n- og-backends/ — direct, opengraph-io, frontmatter-only, proxy-stub\n  behind a registry. Adding a real proxy later is one new module.\n\nType alignment:\n- LinkPreviewData field names mirror the canonical Sources schema in\n  cite-wide so future promote-to-canonical enrichment is additive,\n  not a rename.\n\nSubmodule:\n- Bumps mpstaton-site with the renderer + Card/Rollup components.\n\nDocs:\n- changelog/2026-05-03_01.md (mirrored in packages/lfm/changelog/) —\n  9 architectural decisions captured with rationale and an explicit\n  \"what''s not in this work\" boundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a8ffd2a9a7a46158491400f412fdb6126cd43ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/trees/0a8ffd2a9a7a46158491400f412fdb6126cd43ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/astro-knots/git/commits/b69ed5004787d1bf3460ac6d10da03d745b746bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_