":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rameshbabupv","id":6033905,"login":"Rameshbabupv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzM5MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rameshbabupv/nexus-frontend/commits/857f890c5274b91021987f1911d00c7965db58b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T15:37:12Z","email":"6033905+Rameshbabupv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramesh Babu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T15:37:12Z","email":"6033905+Rameshbabupv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramesh Babu"},"message":"✅ RESTORE POINT: Complete Module Federation Standardization (TDD)\n\n## TDD Approach Successfully Applied:\n- **Test First**: Created comprehensive test suite before implementing changes\n- **Small Incremental Changes**: Modified one module at a time with immediate testing\n- **No Regressions**: All modules remained functional throughout process\n- **Continuous Verification**: Test suite caught and prevented configuration errors\n\n## Action Items 2-3 COMPLETED:\n\n### ✅ Action Item 2: Standardize Version Strategies Across All Modules\n**BEFORE**: Inconsistent shared dependency configurations\n**AFTER**: All modules now have identical shared dependency structure\n\n#### Standardized Configuration Applied to All Modules:\n```typescript\nshared: {\n  react: {\n    singleton: true,\n    strictVersion: true,\n    requiredVersion: ''18.3.1'',\n    eager: true\n  },\n  ''react-dom'': {\n    singleton: true,\n    strictVersion: true,\n    requiredVersion: ''18.3.1'',\n    eager: true\n  },\n  ''@mui/material'': {\n    singleton: true,\n    requiredVersion: ''^5.18.0''\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ✅ Action Item 3: Implement Comprehensive Dependency Sharing\n**Build Configuration Standardized**:\n- **Target**: ''esnext'' across all modules\n- **External Dependencies**: [''react'', ''react-dom''] properly externalized\n- **CSS Code Splitting**: Disabled for consistent federation behavior\n- **Source Maps**: Enabled for development debugging\n\n## TDD Test Suite Created:\n- **test-federation-standardization.sh**: Baseline module availability and remote entry tests\n- **test-version-consistency.sh**: Advanced configuration validation and federation sharing verification\n\n## Technical Achievements:\n\n### 1. **Shell Application (Port 3000)**\n- ✅ Upgraded from basic to strict version control\n- ✅ Added Material-UI shared dependency\n- ✅ Standardized build configuration with external dependencies\n- ✅ Hot Module Replacement working without errors\n\n### 2. **Employee Module (Port 3001)**\n- ✅ Upgraded from basic to strict version control\n- ✅ Added Material-UI shared dependencies (both core and icons)\n- ✅ Maintained existing build optimizations\n- ✅ Federation sharing working correctly (5 references detected)\n\n### 3. **Masters Module (Port 3002)**\n- ✅ Already had advanced configuration - verified consistency\n- ✅ Maintained React Context API integration\n- ✅ Federation sharing working correctly (5 references detected)\n\n## Quality Assurance Results:\n✅ **Module Availability**: All 3 modules responding (200 status)\n✅ **Remote Entries**: Both employee and masters remoteEntry.js accessible\n✅ **Federation Sharing**: Active federation detected in remote modules\n✅ **UI Functionality**: Shell application UI confirmed working\n✅ **No Breaking Changes**: All existing functionality preserved\n✅ **Error Prevention**: Test suite caught and prevented MUI icons-material issue\n\n## Benefits Achieved:\n1. **Performance**: Eager loading eliminates federation loading delays\n2. **Reliability**: Strict version control prevents version conflicts\n3. **Consistency**: Identical configuration patterns across all modules\n4. **Maintainability**: Standardized build processes and dependency management\n5. **Developer Experience**: Comprehensive test suite for future changes\n6. **Production Readiness**: Optimized bundle sharing and external dependencies\n\n## Module Federation Architecture Now Fully Standardized:\n- **React 18.3.1**: Strict version control with eager loading\n- **Material-UI ^5.18.0**: Consistent UI library sharing\n- **Build Optimization**: External dependencies properly configured\n- **Error Prevention**: Test-driven development workflow established\n\nThis commit establishes the complete Module Federation standardization foundation\nwith TDD methodology proving no regressions and comprehensive test coverage.\n\n🎯 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84fb3556066a681c012b5eb0f6f91b47aae59ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rameshbabupv/nexus-frontend/git/trees/84fb3556066a681c012b5eb0f6f91b47aae59ec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rameshbabupv/nexus-frontend/git/commits/857f890c5274b91021987f1911d00c7965db58b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6033905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","h