github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rameshbabupv/nexus-frontend/commits/4c4ce50f75d5d9852e58dac2d57dbe782a4907d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T15:25:36Z","email":"6033905+Rameshbabupv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramesh Babu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T15:25:36Z","email":"6033905+Rameshbabupv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramesh Babu"},"message":"✅ RESTORE POINT: Fix Administration menu and Masters Module integration\n\n## Problem Solved:\n- Administration menu click resulted in blank white page\n- Masters Module wasn''t properly integrated with Shell navigation\n- Missing hierarchical menu structure for Master entries\n\n## Key Changes:\n\n### 1. Fixed Module Federation Import Issue (src/components/shared/MastersModuleWrapper.tsx)\n- **CREATED**: New MastersModuleWrapper component\n- **CHANGED**: Import from ''mastersModule/MastersApp'' to ''mastersModule/CompanyMaster''\n- **REASON**: MastersApp exported bare component without Context provider\n- **SOLUTION**: CompanyMaster (ReactContextVersion) is self-contained with React Context\n- **RESULT**: Eliminates blank page, provides proper Material-UI theme integration\n\n### 2. Enhanced Navigation Structure (src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx)\n- **ADDED**: Hierarchical menu system with expand/collapse functionality\n- **STRUCTURE**: Administration parent → Company Master, Employee Master, Department Master submenus\n- **FEATURES**: Visual expand/collapse indicators (▶▼), nested indentation, active state highlighting\n- **STATE**: React state for tracking expanded sections, defaults Administration open\n- **STATUS**: Dynamic status indicators per module type (Built-in, Remote, Not Implemented)\n\n### 3. Updated Route Handling (src/components/layout/Layout.tsx)\n- **ADDED**: ''company-master'' route → MastersModuleWrapper\n- **ADDED**: Placeholder UI for ''employee-master'', ''department-master''\n- **ENHANCED**: User-friendly \"Coming Soon\" messages with styled alerts\n- **INTEGRATION**: Proper import and usage of new MastersModuleWrapper\n\n## Technical Architecture:\n- **Module Federation**: Shell (3000) → Masters Module (3002) via React Context API\n- **State Management**: React Context (Level 2) - Module Federation compatible\n- **Error Handling**: ErrorBoundary + Suspense with loading states\n- **UI Framework**: Material-UI components shared via Module Federation\n- **Navigation**: Dynamic hierarchical sidebar with visual feedback\n\n## Testing Verified:\n✅ Shell application loads at http://localhost:3000\n✅ Administration section expands to show submenus\n✅ Company Master loads Masters Module successfully\n✅ Material-UI components render properly (no theme conflicts)\n✅ React Context API provides stable state management\n✅ Hot Module Replacement works without errors\n✅ Error boundaries handle Module Federation failures gracefully\n\n## Module Federation Architecture:\n- **Shell**: Navigation orchestration + module loading\n- **Masters**: React Context API + Material-UI + Company Master tabs\n- **Integration**: Shared dependencies (React, React-DOM, Material-UI) with strictVersion\n- **Compatibility**: Zero React hooks conflicts with proper singleton configuration\n\n## Future Development Ready:\n- Employee Master: Placeholder with \"Coming Soon\" UI\n- Department Master: Placeholder with \"Coming Soon\" UI\n- Expandable architecture for additional Master modules\n\nThis commit establishes a stable restore point for the Administration menu system\nwith full Masters Module integration via Module Federation React Context API.\n\n🎯 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccce101908fbbc970d70937a1b58ed127f3cf580","url":"h