lysis: Employee=3504B, Masters=2187B (optimized sizes)\n- Shared Dependencies: __federation_shared_@mui/material-*.js properly generated\n- All Services: Shell (200), Employee (200), Masters (200) responding\n- Module Federation: Remote entry points accessible and working\n\n## 🧪 TDD Success Metrics\n- ✅ 11/11 automated tests passed\n- ✅ Zero rollback required\n- ✅ No regression in existing functionality\n- ✅ Performance optimization achieved\n\nReady for testing team validation!\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c32ae97aa0f8fe3b9959a12b481b788c7519c91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rameshbabupv/nexus-frontend/git/trees/9c32ae97aa0f8fe3b9959a12b481b788c7519c91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rameshbabupv/nexus-frontend/git/commits/ecf0c50fa7ab27f7b0f8c96543dade034c79cf1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6033905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rameshbabupv","id":6033905,"login":"Rameshbabupv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzM5MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rameshbabupv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http