allenge/commits/c130075e32df30e91eeb28e1f608be7c519875bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-11T18:10:06Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-11T18:10:06Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"message":"fix: create subscriptions in PENDING status to allow immediate enrollment\n\n- Start subscriptions in PENDING status instead of DRAFT to enable immediate user interaction\n- Initialize state machine in ENROLLMENT_STARTED state for proper payment flow\n- Remove unnecessary startEnrollment method and related DRAFT state logic\n- Update validation to allow enrollment steps and item modifications in PENDING status\n- Eliminate chicken-and-egg problem where users couldn''t interact with new subscriptions","tree":{"sha":"a18b6861124dd29e81c46414a2691ec268f1e29d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/trees/a18b6861124dd29e81c46414a2691ec268f1e29d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/commits/c130075e32df30e91eeb28e1f608be7c519875bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/c130075e32df30e91eeb28e1f608be7c519875bf","node_id":"C_kwDOPcLMGNoAKGMxMzAwNzVlMzJkZjMwZTkxZWViMjhlMWY2MDhiZTdjNTE5ODc1YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/1e537ff29accb32106edba60fd4ce1142a7ffe29","sha":"1e537ff29accb32106edba60fd4ce1142a7ffe29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/1e537ff29accb32106edba60fd4ce1142a7ffe29"}],"sha":"c130075e32df30e91eeb28e1f608be7c519875bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/c130075e32df30e91eeb28e1f608be7c519875bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/1e537ff29accb32106edba60fd4ce1142a7ffe29/comments","commit":{"au