 success toast with employee name\n  - Include name in selected employee details\n- Implemented `Subscriptions` page UI:\n  - Display list/grid of subscriptions with type, plan, employee name, start/end dates, and status badge\n  - Loading and error states\n  - Empty state prompt to create first subscription\n- Added `Demographic` and `SubscriptionsResponse` types to `types/index.ts`","tree":{"sha":"8c94ac0d3601bcc9255f129471e2c569f11fd9c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/trees/8c94ac0d3601bcc9255f129471e2c569f11fd9c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/commits/517bea5e9d02de67eefdaa8c5eabdad07a6362a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/517bea5e9d02de67eefdaa8c5eabdad07a6362a0","node_id":"C_kwDOPcLMGNoAKDUxN2JlYTVlOWQwMmRlNjdlZWZkYWE4YzVlYWJkYWQwN2E2MzYyYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5","sha":"ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5"}],"sha":"517bea5e9d02de67eefdaa8c5eabdad07a6362a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/517bea5e9d02de67eefdaa8c5eabdad07a6362a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T22:34:55Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T22:34:55Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"message":"feat(subscription): add frontend create subscription flow with toast notifications\n\n- Backend GraphQL:\n  - Made `employee` and `plan` fields on `HealthcareSubscription` nullable to match optional data\n  - Updated schema.gql accordingly\n\n- Frontend:\n  - Added `react-hot-toast` for user feedback and configured `<Toaster />` in `App.tsx`\n  - Created `useCreateSubscription` hook to call `createSubscription` mutation with error handling\n  - Added `CREATE_SUBSCRIPTION_MUTATION` to `queries.ts`\n  - Integrated `useCreateSubscription` into `NewSubscription` page\n    - Submits form data to backend\n    - Displays success/error toasts\n    - Handles loading and error states in the UI\n  - Disabled save button while mutation is in progress\n  - Updated error display to include mutation errors\n  - Added `HealthcareSubscription` type to `types/index.ts`\n  - Minor lint suppressions for `ui/button.tsx` and `ui/badge.tsx` exports","tree":{"sha":"b3ae4cc421c0f3140487bee2489f91af8f34c36c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/trees/b3ae4cc421c0f3140487bee2489f91af8f34c36c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/commits/ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5","node_id":"C_kwDOPcLMGNoAKGNlMjg2YzExZTczNDcwYmE3NjkxOTdlNTViYzQxMGE0OGU3OTA5YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/0b33a609edc2902b94adea1430ba2f593c6389ac","sha":"0b33a609edc2902b94adea1430ba2f593c6389ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/0b33a609edc2902b94adea1430ba2f593c6389ac"}],"sha":"ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/ce286c11e73470ba769197e55bc410a48e7909a5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/0b33a609edc2902b94adea1430ba2f593c6389ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T22:23:06Z","email":"leo@