":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/d2ea5a48b26164c07bf129510a257cc7e48dbf56","node_id":"C_kwDOPcLMGNoAKGQyZWE1YTQ4YjI2MTY0YzA3YmYxMjk1MTBhMjU3Y2M3ZTQ4ZGJmNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229","sha":"3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229"}],"sha":"d2ea5a48b26164c07bf129510a257cc7e48dbf56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/d2ea5a48b26164c07bf129510a257cc7e48dbf56"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T19:58:47Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T19:58:47Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"message":"feat(frontend): integrate shadcn/ui with design token system and modernized UI components\n\n- Added `components.json` with shadcn/ui configuration and path aliases\n- Installed new dependencies: `@radix-ui/react-slot` and `tw-animate-css`\n- Replaced `badge-variants.ts` and `button-variants.ts` with inline `cva`-based styles inside component files\n- Refactored UI components (`Badge`, `Button`, `Breadcrumb`, `Card`, `Checkbox`, `Input`, `Label`, `Select`) to:\n  - Use Radix Slot API for `asChild` rendering\n  - Apply `data-slot` attributes for better styling and testing\n  - Align with updated design system styles and accessibility improvements\n- Overhauled `index.css`:\n  - Added `tw-animate-css` import and dark mode variant\n  - Defined OKLCH color tokens for light/dark themes\n  - Improved base styles, typography, and scrollbar styling\n- Enhanced `tailwind.config.js`:\n  - Mapped CSS variables to Tailwind color tokens\n  - Extended theme with new gradients, shadows, spacing, animations, and font family\n- Updated `Subscriptions` and `NewSubscription` pages with improved layout, animations, and modern UI patterns\n- Enabled path aliases in `tsconfig.json` for cleaner imports\n\nThis commit modernizes the UI layer, centralizes design tokens, and sets up shadcn/ui for scalable, themeable component development.","tree":{"sha":"64b76d844f8e0fa201f21676c5a400a2cab6c287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/trees/64b76d844f8e0fa201f21676c5a400a2cab6c287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/commits/3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229","node_id":"C_kwDOPcLMGNoAKDNmMDgxMzczZDVhMjBjZGVhYTBmNjg3YTQ2ZDFkMzAxMzRhYzcyMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037","sha":"491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037"}],"sha":"3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/3f081373d5a20cdeaa0f687a46d1d30134ac7229"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T19:02:58Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T19:02:58Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"message":"feat: update routing to make Subscriptions page the new home\n\n- Redirect root path (/) to /subscriptions using Navigate component\n- Remove unused Home component and clean up imports\n- Maintain consistent URL structure with /subscriptions as canonical route\n- Preserve existing navigation flows and breadcrumbs\n- Use replace flag to prevent back-button navigation issues\n\nThe Subscriptions page now serves as the main entry point for the application,\nproviding users immediate access to healthcare subscription management.","tree":{"sha":"e53d3655b40eeb6e1645e90a21c70d534e254d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/trees/e53d3655b40eeb6e1645e90a21c70d534e254d39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/git/commits/491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037","node_id":"C_kwDOPcLMGNoAKDQ5MWViNDgzMGU2MGEwYzJmNTEzNDNjOTFiMjU2ODg3MGEwNGUwMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commit/28422927282812bf6486dcb2c540622b09410bf0","sha":"28422927282812bf6486dcb2c540622b09410bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/28422927282812bf6486dcb2c540622b09410bf0"}],"sha":"491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/491eb4830e60a0c2f51343c91b2568870a04e037"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeoDoldan7/atlas-challenge/commits/28422927282812bf6486dcb2c540622b09410bf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T18:58:20Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T18:58:20Z","email":"leo@leodoldan.com","name":"Leo Doldan"},"message":"feat: implement Shadcn/UI components and redesign New Subscription form\n\n- Add comprehensive Shadcn/UI component library with all required components\n- Redesign New Subscription page with professional 