m","name":"rishabh913623"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-11T19:52:24Z","email":"rishabh91362@gmail.com","name":"rishabh913623"},"message":"🎉 Initial commit: ExpenseFlow - Modern Expense Tracker\n\n✨ Features:\n- Beautiful modern UI with glass morphism and animations\n- Dual view system (cards/table) with smooth transitions\n- Advanced filtering and search capabilities\n- Real-time statistics dashboard with gradient cards\n- UPI and Cash payment tracking with detailed information\n- Responsive mobile-first design that works on all devices\n- Dark/light theme support with smooth transitions\n- CSV export functionality for data analysis\n- Comprehensive Spring Boot backend with REST APIs\n- Full test coverage with unit and integration tests\n- Professional documentation and contributing guidelines\n\n🛠 Tech Stack:\n- Backend: Java 17, Spring Boot 3.2.0, Spring Data JPA, H2 Database\n- Frontend: HTML5, CSS3 (Glass Morphism), Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+)\n- Design: Modern UI/UX, Responsive Design, Accessibility Compliant\n- Testing: JUnit 5, MockMvc, Integration Tests\n- Build: Maven, Spring Boot Maven Plugin\n\n🎨 UI Highlights:\n- Glass morphism navigation with backdrop blur\n- Gradient backgrounds with floating animated shapes\n- Smooth 60fps animations and micro-interactions\n- Professional Inter font typography\n- Color-coded payment methods and categories\n- Beautiful toast notifications and modal dialogs\n- Floating action button for quick access\n- Keyboard shortcuts for power users\n\n📱 Mobile Features:\n- Touch-friendly interface with large tap targets\n- Responsive grid layouts that adapt to screen size\n- Mobile-optimized navigation and forms\n- Swipe gestures and touch interactions\n- Perfect rendering on all device sizes\n\n🔧 Developer Experience:\n- Clean, well-documented code with JavaDoc\n- Comprehensive error handling and validation\n- RESTful API design with proper HTTP status codes\n- Automated testing with high code coverage\n- Easy setup with single command execution\n- Professional project structure and organization","tree":{"sha":"11dd6a6495f11884448d41b4915227fb7fa1aa71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabh913623/expenseflow/git/trees/11dd6a6495f11884448d41b4915227fb7fa1aa71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabh913623/expenseflow/git/commits/7454cd368e3c9c5b8a96400533d5409c9ccbcf2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157561560?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rishabh913623","id":157561560,"login":"rishabh913623","node_id":"U_kgDOCWQy2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishabh913623","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rishabh913623/expenseflow/commit/7454cd368e3c9c5b8a96400533d5409c9ccbcf2d","node_id":"C_kwDOPcQI1NoAKDc0NTRjZDM2OGUzYzljNWI4YTk2NDAwNTMzZDU0MDljOWNjYmNmMmQ","parents":[],"sha":"7454cd368e3c9c5b8a96400533d5409c9ccbcf2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabh913623/expenseflow/commits/7454cd368e3c9c5b8a96400533d5409c9ccbcf2d"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabh913623/expenseflow/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=b65e4929ae21a2b834aeeae97946456e19844c29&since=2025-03-31