ing floating promises by adding `void` or handling the promise.\n- Changing default exports to named exports to comply with the project''s convention.\n- Removing unnecessary type assertions.\n- Replacing the logical OR operator (`||`) with the nullish coalescing operator (`??`) where appropriate.\n- Removing a `console.log` statement.\n\nThe following files were modified:\n- `packages/client/src/components/GenerateFakeProjects.tsx`\n- `packages/client/src/components/GenericInfiniteTable.tsx`\n- `packages/client/src/components/MigrateData.tsx`\n- `packages/client/src/components/Projects.tsx`\n- `packages/client/src/components/ValidateData.tsx`\n- `packages/client/src/hooks/swagger-hooks.ts`\n- `packages/client/src/hooks/useSearch.ts`\n- `packages/client/src/routes/email-generation.tsx`\n- `packages/client/src/types/inky.d.ts`\n- `packages/mailing/src/PreviewEmailTemplate.tsx`\n- `packages/server/src/WebApp.ts`\n- `packages/mailing/src/template.tsx` (and related files)\n\n**Note:** The linting errors in `packages/client/src/routes/templates.tsx` and `packages/mailing/src/template.tsx` could not be resolved. These errors seem to be caused by a deeper issue with how the linter''s type-aware rules are interacting with the project''s monorepo setup, specifically with how types are resolved from the `@org/mailing` package. Further investigation is needed to address this issue.","tree":{"sha":"102d07ef462bc074c71b0722df3ac0d0c89975ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jlcanela/project-app/git/trees/102d07ef462bc074c71b0722df3ac0d0c89975ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jlcanela/project-app/git/commits/6c03f75496ed498aef154a05a1da6653224fe369","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-