f3613923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethwick96/vibe-coding/commits/ae3953942af305207a279b1a8815dd8af3613923"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/sethwick96/vibe-coding/commit/3d9cd5b5afea924fd4407e0f1c330f026fa4520b","sha":"3d9cd5b5afea924fd4407e0f1c330f026fa4520b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethwick96/vibe-coding/commits/3d9cd5b5afea924fd4407e0f1c330f026fa4520b"}],"sha":"c488eca9047bcdfc81e5ee14bea15c760180fd84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethwick96/vibe-coding/commits/c488eca9047bcdfc81e5ee14bea15c760180fd84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethwick96/vibe-coding/commits/3d9cd5b5afea924fd4407e0f1c330f026fa4520b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-11T19:08:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-11T19:08:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Build complete Sprint Planning web application\n\nCreated a production-ready React application with the following features:\n\nCore Features:\n- Dashboard view with sprint list and filtering\n- Sprint Setup Wizard with capacity planning\n- Goal Creation linked to Jira epics\n- Planning Board with drag-and-drop ticket assignment\n- Finalization Flow with validation and warnings\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- React 18 with TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS with custom bronze color scheme\n- dnd-kit for drag-and-drop functionality\n- React Context API for state management\n- Single-spa integration for microfrontend support\n- Vite for fast development and optimized builds\n\nComponents Created:\n- Dashboard: Sprint cards, metrics, filtering\n- SprintSetup: Multi-step wizard, capacity settings\n- GoalCreation: Epic selector, goal form\n- PlanningBoard: Team sections, goal cards, backlog sidebar\n- Finalization: Summary statistics, warnings, confirmation flow\n- Shared: Button, Card, Input, Select, Modal, CapacityBar\n\nMock Data:\n- 6 epics across different domains\n- 30 tickets with story points and team assignments\n- 2 sample sprints for testing\n\nArchitecture:\n- Clean component structure\n- Type-safe TypeScript interfaces\n- Reusable shared components\n- Prepared for Jira Server API integration\n- Ready for deployment as standalone or microfrontend\n\nBuild verified: TypeScript compilation successful, production build complete","tree":{"sha":"fb8d61c0de0c8c0dd491f2ce22f93d9d58c7c239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethwick96/vibe-coding/git/trees/fb8d61c0de0c8c0dd491f2ce22f93d9d58c7c239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethwick96/vibe-coding/git/commits/3d9cd5b5afea924fd4407e0f1c330f026fa4520b","verification":{"payload":"tree fb8d61c0de0c8c0dd491f2ce22f93d9d58c7c239\nparent ae3953942af305207a279b1a8815dd8af3613923\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1768158507 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1768158507 +0000\n\nBuild complete Sprint Planning web application\n\nCreated a production-ready React application with the following features:\n\nCore Features:\n- Dashboard view with sprint list and filtering\n- Sprint Setup Wizard with capacity planning\n- Goal Creation linked to Jira epics\n- Planning Board with drag-and-drop ticket assignment\n- Finalization Flow with validation and warnings\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- React 18 with TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS with custom bronze color scheme\n- dnd-kit for drag-and-drop functionality\n- React Context API for state management\n- Single-spa integration for microfrontend support\n- Vite for fast development and optimized builds\n\nComponents Created:\n- Dashboard: Sprint cards, metrics, filtering\n- SprintSetup: Multi-step wizard, capacity settings\n- GoalCreation: Epic selector, goal form\n- PlanningBoard: Team sections, goal cards, backlog sidebar\n- Finalization: Summary statistics, warnings, confirmation flow\n- Shared: Button, Card, Input, Select, Modal, CapacityBar\n\nMock Data:\n- 6 epics across different domains\n- 30 tickets with story points and team assignments\n- 2 sample sprints for testing\n\nArchitecture:\n- Clean component structure\n- Type-safe TypeScript interfaces\n- Reusable shared components\n- Prepared for Jira Server API integration\n- Ready for deployment as standalone or microfrontend\n\nBuild verified: TypeScript compilation successful, production build complete\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBGOjMxu\nEdkdBSzp4Ka6jHk7YMRwWVVIvPg/QNSHGI0vTzs6+tVj2zjIC+k/Ql5Iu+/Deia3GwBhnlKWPvxJ\nrgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-11T19:08:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://githu