 next.svg, thirteen.svg, and vercel.svg for improved UI navigation.\n\nfeat: create basic components and layout structure\n\n- Implemented Button and Header components.\n- Created a global CSS file for styling.\n- Established a main layout with breadcrumb context for navigation.\n\nfeat: set up TypeScript configuration and types\n\n- Configured TypeScript with tsconfig.json.\n- Defined BreadcrumbItem and LayoutProps interfaces for type safety.\n\nfeat: implement dynamic routing and breadcrumb context\n\n- Developed BreadcrumbContext for managing breadcrumb state.\n- Created ConfigTable component for audit configuration.\n- Integrated dynamic loading of ConfigTable in the Audit page.\n\nfix: update host app configuration for remote modules\n\n- Adjusted next.config.js to include audit remote module.\n- Updated package.json scripts for consistent port usage.\n\nfix: correct remote app configuration\n\n- Fixed remote app name in next.config.js.\n- Ensured shared dependencies for React and ReactDOM in remote app.","tree":{"sha":"dc74200f5f1a53e9ee2597600fc2d262d1793812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sixgillkrahs/microfrontends-nextjs/git/trees/dc74200f5f1a53e9ee2597600fc2d262d1793812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sixgillkrahs/microfrontends-nextjs/git/commits/4779d5ea6dcb55d81a48f313821e1e549cb54973","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sixgillkrahs/microfrontends-nextjs/commit/4779d5ea6dcb55d81a48f313821e1e549cb54973","node_id":"C_kwDOPcmOsNoAKDQ3NzlkNWVhNmRjYjU1ZDgxYTQ4ZjMxMzgyMWUxZTU0OWNiNTQ5NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sixgillkrahs/microfrontends-nextjs/commit/f28bdb6b8a6b1957ee11e0edc0138df6b7c7ee80","sha":"f28bdb6b8a6b1957ee11e0edc0138df6b7c7ee80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sixgillkrahs/microfrontends-nextjs/commits/f28bdb6b8a6b1957ee11e0edc0138df6b7c7ee80"}],"sha":"4779d5ea6dcb55d81a48f313821e1e549cb54973",