ply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":" [ASE-799] integrate course api (#25)\n\n* add getAllExams call\n\n* integrate exam api data\n\n* delete getOneExamData\n\n* add formatting\n\n* fix invalid date\n\n* lint fix\n\n* refactor: update exam data types to CourseResponse and ExamResponse\n\n- Rename ExamDataResponse to ExamResponse\n- Add CourseResponse interface with course details\n- Update exam properties to match new API structure\n\n* feat: add courses Redux slice for state management\n\n- Create coursesSlice with actions for managing course data\n- Integrate courses reducer into root reducer\n- Add loading, error, and cache management\n\n* refactor: update API hook to fetch courses by student ID\n\n- Rename getAllExams to getAllCourses\n- Use student ID from useUser hook\n- Update endpoint to /data/students/{studentId}/courses\n\n* refactor: integrate course API data into semester components\n\n- Update ModuleOverviewComponent to fetch and transform course data\n- Export shared types (Assessment, ModuleData)\n- Update AssessmentTable and ModuleDetailView to use shared types\n- Map API responses to component data structures\n\n* feat: filter semester boxes based on available course data\n\n- Only show semester options that have actual course data\n- Extract semester numbers from course responses\n\n* fix: use actual student ID from useUser hook in ExamDocumentModal\n\n- Replace MOCK_STUDENT_ID with getUserId() from useUser hook\n- Add validation for student ID availability\n- Fix document filter to use examId property\n\n* feat: add ExamDetailsModal component\n\n- Create new modal to display detailed exam information\n- Show room, maxPoints, duration, and allowed tools\n- Use MUI Joy components with icons for visual clarity\n- Fully responsive design\n\n* feat: extend Assessment type with exam details\n\n- Add room, maxPoints, duration, and tools fields\n- Map exam data from API response to Assessment type\n- Enable displaying comprehensive exam information\n\n* feat: add row click to open exam details modal\n\n- Integrate ExamDetailsModal into AssessmentTable\n- Add onRowClick handler to table configuration\n- Prevent event propagation on submit button clicks\n- Allow users to view detailed exam info by clicking rows\n\n* i18n: add translations for exam details modal\n\n- Add English translations for all modal fields\n- Add German translations for all modal fields\n- Include labels for room, maxPoints, duration, and tools\n\n* refactor: use shared components Modal in ExamDetailsModal\n\n- Replace MUI Joy Modal/ModalDialog with shared Modal component\n- Update props from onClose to setOpen for consistency\n- Remove InfoOutlinedIcon from header (now handled by Modal)\n- Clean up component structure and simplify imports\n- Align with ExamDocumentModal implementation pattern\n\n* fix lint\n\n* disable dropzone tests tmp\n\n* fix lint\n\n* fix prettier line ending\n\n* remove console.log statemetns\n\n* Fix exam type translation reactivity\n\n- Store raw exam type instead of translated value in data processing\n- Translate exam types at render time to support language switching\n- Updated AssessmentTable, ExamDetailsModal, and AssessmentInfoCard\n\n* replace duplications off AssessmentType\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: MCLemuri <elefine@mail.de>","tree":{"sha":"427729940c03a72dccdf224f0f0016b0892014c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/git/trees/427729940c03a72dccdf224f0f0016b0892014c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/git/commits/009f09262bfa4c4e1e629dd0a1b537e4b5d44727","verification":{"payload":"tree 427729940c03a72dccdf224f0f0016b0892014c3\nparent 87e9a3839b55edd9aec560b34b4bfdd263a08712\nauthor Simon <104859696+py-bay@users.noreply.github.com> 1761939661 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761939661 +0100\n\n [ASE-799] integrate course api (#25)\n\n* add getAllExams call\n\n* integrate exam api data\n\n* delete getOneExamData\n\n* add formatting\n\n* fix invalid date\n\n* lint fix\n\n* refactor: update exam data types to CourseResponse and ExamResponse\n\n- Rename ExamDataResponse to ExamResponse\n- Add CourseResponse interface with course details\n- Update exam properties to match new API structure\n\n* feat: add courses Redux slice for state management\n\n- Create coursesSlice with actions for managing course data\n- Integrate courses reducer into root reducer\n- Add loading, error, and cache management\n\n* refactor: update API hook to fetch courses by student ID\n\n- Rename getAllExams to getAllCourses\n- Use student ID from useUser hook\n- Update endpoint to /data/students/{studentId}/courses\n\n* refactor: integrate course API data into semester components\n\n- Update ModuleOverviewComponent to fetch and transform course data\n- Export shared types (Assessment, ModuleData)\n- Update AssessmentTable and ModuleDetailView to use shared types\n- Map API responses to component data structures\n\n* feat: filter semester boxes based on available course data\n\n- Only show semester options that have actual course data\n- Extract semester numbers from course responses\n\n* fix: use actual student ID from useUser hook in ExamDocumentModal\n\n- Replace MOCK_STUDENT_ID with getUserId() from useUser hook\n- Add validation for student ID availability\n- Fix document filter to use examId property\n\n* feat: add ExamDetailsModal component\n\n- Create new modal to display detailed exam information\n- Show room, maxPoints, duration, and allowed tools\n- Use MUI Joy components with icons for visual clarity\n- Fully responsive design\n\n* feat: extend Assessment type with exam details\n\n- Add room, maxPoints, duration, and tools fields\n- Map exam data from API response to Assessment type\n- Enable displaying comprehensive exam information\n\n* feat: add row click to open exam details modal\n\n- Integrate ExamDetailsModal into AssessmentTable\n- Add onRowClick handler to table configuration\n- Prevent event propagation on submit button clicks\n- Allow users to view detailed exam info by clicking rows\n\n* i18n: add translations for exam details modal\n\n- Add English translations for all modal fields\n- Add German translations for all modal fields\n- Include labels for room, maxPoints, duration, and tools\n\n* refactor: use shared components Modal in ExamDetailsModal\n\n- Replace MUI Joy Modal/ModalDialog with shared Modal component\n- Update props from onClose to setOpen for consistency\n- Remove InfoOutlinedIcon from header (now handled by Modal)\n- Clean up component structure and simplify imports\n- Align with ExamDocumentModal implementation pattern\n\n* fix lint\n\n* disable dropzone tests tmp\n\n* fix lint\n\n* fix prettier line ending\n\n* remove console.log statemetns\n\n* Fix exam type translation reactivity\n\n- Store raw exam type instead of translated value in data processing\n- Translate exam types at render time to support language switching\n- Updated AssessmentTable, ExamDetailsModal, and AssessmentInfoCard\n\n* replace duplications off AssessmentType\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: MCLemuri <elefine@mail.de>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpBRDNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnf8QAAki83lKzr7CRB6MmMa8askI\nK9XvzRVx85TjRVeJ0t0XNoWhXHjzBGNeJy0YVf8iHmcLzLPp2UARrIsNP1drQV54\nzSFEDvl20mQMqzBVhhosfY6K0CrPZ8EcNLgbwPstxcVnVUJamVnmY+Uzly1vOGLd\nGIgbSTbUH+y3OJs6FNShw8gqxjWX++J3keH6LbxKwC3+WRkHhb7HLUk+DIoo0k84\ncsL/35F3WbWy2seIf8Q9fPKKGp87VgxpOD//cKkd78yzF74osUJJngKYG+gs/Ie2\n/JGOdqk2Y85AyRB1JEqgIMOihQq3IK1eEqTjWXHXAPyoVYtH99kk9Hb9DMGk6PWL\nX7BRlzzqiR9d49BDeabo8KZEVtINPMc8p4gYkN1uv3y5KP41a8BbaUaVpd+z2GPs\nX0CsPGSGfEygIW6/7kcY5LLwxHGcj4fKA/rpArsrN4r3c4UCGoxN28vTYCXM+5vG\nvQUgm5Jv23YPrD5fkiA0BgmlHdYDkydRlSvVRTx1izHnzXtGpDlFZ2NBfRKWT/+Z\nNo5se0IQZvR64i/Fju0tg2JhyBWWQzMjT+YN+kv9ovAjyemeYnJ8VCznTjdwUm1t\nTbdUkWD2yUwS2n4Fj+dtS48i7PeQuTSTZa2KB929XVacX1q/ZOCf4nxUKu1