:"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/py-bay","id":104859696,"login":"py-bay","node_id":"U_kgDOBkAIMA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/commits/7cff565ba862ca2720d3cbe7e579b9e97843b039/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-28T14:58:57Z","email":"104859696+py-bay@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Simon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-28T14:58:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[ASE-000] Add useUser hook for authenticated user data access (#20)\n\n* Add useUser hook with debug display for user UUID access\n\nImplements useUser hook to access authenticated user data including UUID for API requests. Includes temporary debug component and console logging marked for removal.\n\n* Clean up whitespace in Home.tsx\n\n* Add local development setup with test user localStorage injection\n\n- Modified singleSpa.tsx to use rootComponent and extract user from props\n- Modified standalone.tsx to load test user from localStorage in dev mode\n- Added scripts/setupLocalStorage.js to create setup page on dev start\n- Added src/utils/testUserSetup.ts for localStorage test user loading\n- Updated npm dev script to run setup before starting vite server\n- Navigate to /setup-local-user.html after starting dev server to inject test user\n\n* Simplify local dev setup: auto-inject test user without extra navigation\n\n- Test user data now embedded directly in testUserSetup.ts\n- Automatically injects test user into localStorage on first load\n- No need to navigate to separate setup page anymore\n- Removed setupLocalStorage.js script (no longer needed)\n- Dev workflow: just run ''npm run dev'' and test user is ready\n\n* Remove .gemini/settings.json from version control and add to .gitignore\n\n* add missing import\n\n* fix lint","tree":{"sha":"30feea15dffbff4aec5bb0465ad676fb02e927cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/git/trees/30feea15dffbff4aec5bb0465ad676fb02e927cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/git/commits/7cff565ba862ca2720d3cbe7e579b9e97843b039","verification":{"payload":"tree 30feea15dffbff4aec5bb0465ad676fb02e927cd\nparent 07da745f2fcc88d2843ea27bc485903712a00676\nauthor Simon <104859696+py-bay@users.noreply.github.com> 1761663537 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761663537 +0100\n\n[ASE-000] Add useUser hook for authenticated user data access (#20)\n\n* Add useUser hook with debug display for user UUID access\n\nImplements useUser hook to access authenticated user data including UUID for API requests. Includes temporary debug component and console logging marked for removal.\n\n* Clean up whitespace in Home.tsx\n\n* Add local development setup with test user localStorage injection\n\n- Modified singleSpa.tsx to use rootComponent and extract user from props\n- Modified standalone.tsx to load test user from localStorage in dev mode\n- Added scripts/setupLocalStorage.js to create setup page on dev start\n- Added src/utils/testUserSetup.ts for localStorage test user loading\n- Updated npm dev script to run setup before starting vite server\n- Navigate to /setup-local-user.html after starting dev server to inject test user\n\n* Simplify local dev setup: auto-inject test user without e