subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/py-bay","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/commits/ba5376c010f35f0fc29e717223c9aac4c2e9613b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-07T07:39:47Z","email":"104859696+py-bay@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Simon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-07T07:39:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[ASE-760] Exam Document Upload/Delete with Deadline Validation (#11)\n\n* [ASE-760] Add exam document upload/delete with deadline validation (WIP)\n\nImplement exam document management functionality with deadline-based access control.\n\n## Features\n- Upload exam documents via API integration\n- View uploaded documents per assessment\n- Delete documents (disabled after deadline)\n- Download documents on click\n- Deadline validation (frontend)\n- Redux state management for documents\n- Error handling with user feedback\n- Loading states\n\n## Technical\n- Created Redux slice for exam documents\n- Created useExamDocumentsApi hook following existing patterns\n- Integrated with backend API (POST, GET, DELETE endpoints)\n- Added TypeScript types for API models\n- Extended Assessment type with examId and deadline fields\n\n## Known Issues\n- Loading state behavior needs refinement\n- UI beautification pending\n- Requires backend CORS configuration for localhost:5173\n- MOCK_STUDENT_ID needs to be replaced with actual auth\n\n## Testing\n- Basic functionality tested with backend\n- Build passes successfully\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* wip\n\n* refactor: rename DocumentModal to ExamDocumentModal\n\n* refactor: replace GenericModal with shared Modal component in ExamDocumentModal\n\n* feat: add i18n translations for exam document modal\n\nAdd English and German translations for all ExamDocumentModal\ncomponents including upload sections, file management, and\nassessment information display.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: improve Redux state management for exam documents\n\n- Merge documents instead of replacing to prevent data loss\n- Add clearDocuments action for cleanup\n- Set state to idle after add/remove operations\n- Fix persistent loading state after delete/upload operations\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: split ExamDocumentModal into reusable components\n\nExtract modal sections into separate components for better\nmaintainability and code organization:\n- AssessmentInfoCard: Display assessment details with deadline\n- ErrorBanner: Reusable error/warning display\n- LecturerFilesSection: Show lecturer-provided files\n- StudentDocumentsList: Display uploaded documents\n- UploadSection: Handle file selection and upload\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: enhance exam document upload functionality\n\n- Move upload button below dropzone for better UX\n- Fix FileList handling from Dropzone component\n- Add dropzone reset after successful upload\n- Improve multi-file upload handling and error reporting\n- Add empty state message when no documents uploaded\n- Prevent loading flicker during batch uploads\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add upload status indicator to assessment table\n\n- Display \"Hochgeladen\" badge when documents are uploaded\n- Fetch document status on component mount\n- Show real-time upload status with checkmark icon\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update ModuleOverviewComponent imports\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: update AssessmentInfoCard to use shared Card component\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix lint\n\n* fix lint: unexpected any\n\n* remove demo test\n\n* refactor: update API base URL configuration in useExamDocumentsApi\n\n* fix lint\n\n* add TODO to mocka data remove hint\n\n* feat: add error handling types and components for exam document management\n\n* refactor: remove unused index.ts files\n\n* fix imports\n\n* fix duplicate state handling with useState and redux\n\n* fix duplicate state handling with useState and redux\n\n* fix imports and remove unwanted index.ts files\n\n* add i18n for expired chip\n\n* fix duplicate key in i18n files\n\n* remove i18n fallback\n\n* add TODO comments for further implementation of LecturerFilesSection\n\n* fix lint\n\n* fix TODO comments are actual comments and does not get rendered\n\n* remove i18n fallback\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b021ef0714300f7d6c0680d454be771750c2192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/git/trees/4b021ef0714300f7d6c0680d454be771750c2192"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agile-Software-Engineering-25/team-13-frontend-exagrad-student-service/git/commits/ba5376c010f35f0fc29e717223c9aac4c2e9613b","verification":{"payload":"tree 4b021ef0714300f7d6c0680d454be771750c2192\nparent d5e14b07797b3b848cb44d97f541147c1446c8b5\nauthor Simon <104859696+py-bay@users.noreply.github.com> 1759822787 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1759822787 +0200\n\n[ASE-760] Exam Document Upload/Delete with Deadline Validation (#11)\n\n* [ASE-760] Add exam document upload/delete with deadline valida